/* ADDETECTTHRESDB @Bits 0..5 : AACI Detection threshold. If the (lnaRssiDb - agcRssiDb) > ADDETECTTHRESDB, the aaciDetected
                                signal is asserted. It has a range of 0 .. 63. Default value is 40. */

