                                                                            /*!< Bit mask of WLANTXPLDPCHSUBROTATION1 field.*/

/* WLANTXPLDPCHSUBROTATION2 @Bits 16..22 : Defines the amount of right cyclic shift that needs to be performed on the 3n + 2
                                           identity sub-matrix to form the H (parity check) matrix. Valid range is 0 to the
                                           Z-block size defined by WLANTXPLDPCZBLOCKSIZE. Value of 127 defines a null matrix.
                                           Relevant when WLANTXPTXMODE is 0 and WLANTXPENCODERSELECT is 1. Note this field is
                                           only valid if WLANTXPLDPCENCODERPRESENT = 1. */

