/* SWRESET @Bit 23 : Wireless LAN Stream Deparser, Software Reset register SWRESET This register provides a means for resetting
                     all the logic in the Wireless LAN Stream Deparser block. The register is sticky so any reset has to be
                     cleared manually. In other words, any reset applied with this register will NOT automatically clear; it
                     must be manually cleared by writing '0' to this register. This software reset register will reset all logic
                     in the Wireless LAN Stream Deparser including: i. T-Bus Write ports (input data to Stream Input Ports) ii.
                     T-Bus Read ports (output data from Decoder Output Ports) iii. The Wireless LAN Stream Deparser processing
                     core iv. The STBC Multiplexer It WILL NOT reset the wlandeparserregwrap Register Block Wrapper which
                     contains the generated register bank. If the wlandeparserregwrap needs to be reset then the entire Wireless
                     LAN Stream Deparser must be reset using the software reset control in the UCCPCORE registers. Alternatively
                     a hardware reset can be performed. */

